# Signal and universe exports are regenerable in seconds; the prime directive
# keeps derived data out of the repository. Both spellings are ignored: the
# date-stamped form, and the bare names the documented commands in README.md
# and docs/HANDOVER.md actually emit (`--out conviction.csv`).
asx_universe_*.csv
asx_smallcaps_*.csv
cluster_buys_*.csv
conviction_buys_*.csv
universe.csv
smallcaps.csv
cluster.csv
conviction.csv
